&lt;h3&gt;Welcome to Module 3&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So far, we’ve looked &lt;em&gt;at&lt;/em&gt; data. Now we’re going to start &lt;em&gt;seeing&lt;/em&gt; it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Numbers on their own are hard to interpret. A column of 300 values doesn’t naturally tell you a story. But a simple plot often does. Visualisation is often the fastest way to understand what’s going on. Before you start running tests or calculating anything complicated, a good plot can tell you:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
